  "historyNote": "#2515, eff 10-25-83; ss by #4017, eff 3-21-86; EXPIRED: 3-21-92 New. #5491, eff 10-20-92, EXPIRED: 10-20-98 New. #7007, eff 5-26-99; ss by #8879, INTERIM, eff 5-18-07, EXPIRES: 11-14-07; ss by #9024, eff 11-9-07 (from Lab 803.03); ss by #11070, eff 4-11-16",
